<item><title>TRC000570 RPQS for the supply and delivery of fleet and plant parts, workshop supplies and equipment</title>
<description><![CDATA[<b>Tender Details : </b> The purpose of this tender is to establish an approved list of suppliers for the supply and delivery of automotive workshop supplies, tools and consumable items to maintain & repair fleet assets and operate council’s workshops. Council is seeking competitive rates and a high standard of service covering the life of the contract. Council may “refresh” the register of pre-qualified suppliers on a quarterly basis to allow suppliers to be added or removed from council’s register.<br /><br />This is a fixed catalogue less discount contract. Suppliers (including trade and industrial accounts) are to provide a percentage discount off current catalogue or trade pricing.<br /><br />Council reserves the right to verify pricing at any time through reasonable benchmarking, market comparison, or supplier substantiation, including catalogue pricing, trade account pricing, or cost verification where cost-plus arrangements are applied.<br /><br />Council does not guarantee any minimum or maximum purchase quantities under thi...<br /><br /><b>Issued by : </b> Toowoomba Regional Council<br /><b>Closing Date</b> : 27/Oct/2026 02:00 PM (UTC+10:00) Brisbane time<br /><b>Reference number</b> : VP528033<br /><b>Contact person</b> : Not disclosed<br /><b>Tender categories</b> : Fleet Servicing & Accessories<br /><b>Specification Docs</b> : 7]]></description>
<link>https://www.vendorpanel.com.au/tsi.axd?id=06d561db8ab044ad8503ca91780f0380s528033sdf934c4a503b4d398b992edde8194044s1566</link>
