</item>
<item><title>ITT2564 Pavement Marking Services</title>
<description><![CDATA[<b>Tender Details : </b> Tenders are invited for the provision of Pavement Marking Services across the Sunshine Coast Region.<br /><br />Council maintains more than 2,500km of roads, and it is Council’s objective to renew all pavement marking assets over 2 x 3-year cycles. This contract will supplement Council’s internal resources to renew existing pavement marking assets, and complete new pavement marking works as required.<br /><br />The contract will commence on 2 February 2027 with a contract term of six (6) years and will include two (2) x 3-year pavement marking cycles. Contract extension options are one (1) optional extension period of twelve (12) months.<br /><br />All pavement marking works performed under this contract are to be in accordance with the Department of Transport and Main Roads’ Manual of Uniform Traffic Control Devices (MUTCD) (Harmonised) Queensland and the applicable Australian Standards as outlined in Attachment 1 - Technical Specification. There are three (3) types of work contained within the payment marki...<br /><br /><b>Issued by : </b> Sunshine Coast Council<br /><b>Closing Date</b> : 27/Oct/2026 12:00 PM (UTC+10:00) Brisbane time<br /><b>Reference number</b> : VP528075<br /><b>Contact person</b> : Not disclosed<br /><b>Tender categories</b> : Construction & Operation<br /><b>Specification Docs</b> : 6]]></description>
