</item>
<item><title>ITT2535 Pathway and Pedestrian Bridge Eudlo Creek</title>
<description><![CDATA[<b>Tender Details : </b> Tenders are invited for the construction of a new pathway at Eudlo.<br /><br />Council is seeking the services of experienced Contractors to undertake the works which include, but are not limited to:<br /><br />• Construction of a new pedestrian bridge with a 10m span<br /><br />• Construction of Wooden Boardwalk; and<br /><br />• Concrete footpath connections and hard landscaping<br /><br />Council will consider Alternative Tenders when accompanied by a Conforming Tender. Under an Alternate Tender, Respondents may propose alternate substructure or superstructure elements, however significant variations to the bridge layout or geometry will not be considered.<br /><br />This is a lump sum construction contract, with Council seeking to engage one Contractor to undertake the entire construction program of works. The successful Contractor will be required to provide all materials, plant and labour, and to perform all necessary operations of whatever kind, to ensure the completion of works associated with this Co...<br /><br /><b>Issued by : </b> Sunshine Coast Council<br /><b>Closing Date</b> : 27/Oct/2026 12:00 PM (UTC+10:00) Brisbane time<br /><b>Reference number</b> : VP527994<br /><b>Contact person</b> : Not disclosed<br /><b>Tender categories</b> : Building Trade, Repairs, Maint., Construction & Operation<br /><b>Specification Docs</b> : 14]]></description>
