<item><title>ITT266 Construction Works - Caloundra Town Square</title>
<description><![CDATA[<b>Tender Details : </b> Sunshine Coast Council (Council) is seeking to appoint a Principal Contractor (Contractor) to manage, supervise and undertake the construction of a new Town Square on the corner of Bulcock Street and Otranto Avenue, Caloundra, on the site of the former Council administration building.<br /><br />The scope of work includes extensive landscaping works with the construction of a new pavilion, event lawn, accessible pathways and embellishments.<br /><br />Construction Works will include, but not be limited to:<br /><br />• Civil and landscaping works<br /><br />• Architectural and structural works<br /><br />• Hydraulic and electrical infrastructure<br /><br />• Signage and wayfinding<br /><br />Council is looking to engage one Principal Contractor to undertake the entire scope of works. The successful Contractor will be required to provide all materials, plant and labour, and to perform all necessary operations of whatever kind, to ensure the successful completion of the works associated with this Contract.<br /...<br /><br /><b>Issued by : </b> Sunshine Coast Council<br /><b>Closing Date</b> : 27/Oct/2026 12:00 PM (UTC+10:00) Brisbane time<br /><b>Reference number</b> : VP528011<br /><b>Contact person</b> : Not disclosed<br /><b>Tender categories</b> : Architecture, Design, Planning, Building Trade, Repairs, Maint., Construction & Operation<br /><b>Specification Docs</b> : 29]]></description>
