<item><title>T27013 - TH King Oval Lighting Upgrade</title>
<description><![CDATA[<b>Tender Details : </b> Contract No. T27013 - TH King Oval Lighting Upgrade<br /><br />Tenderers are invited for the upgrade of the existing sports lighting infrastructure at TH King Oval, Glen Iris Park, 1650 High Street, Glen Iris.<br /><br />The works generally comprise the removal of the existing sports lighting infrastructure and installation of four new 25-metre sports lighting towers, including new pole footings, LED floodlights, underground electrical and communications services, lighting controls, modifications to the existing electrical infrastructure, testing, commissioning and associated reinstatement works. The completed lighting system is designed to achieve an average lighting level of approximately 200 lux and provide adjustable lighting modes for sporting and community use.<br /><br />A tender briefing will be held on Monday 19 October 2026 at 10:00am. Please refer to the documents for further details.<br /><br />NOTE: The Vendor Panel online forum closes five business days prior to the abovementioned tender closing...<br /><br /><b>Issued by : </b> City of Stonnington<br /><b>Closing Date</b> : 02/Nov/2026 12:00 PM (UTC+10:00) Canberra, Melbourne, Sydney time<br /><b>Reference number</b> : VP528118<br /><b>Contact person</b> : Not disclosed<br /><b>Tender categories</b> : Building Trade, Repairs, Maint., Construction & Operation, ELEC, Lighting, Equip & Services, Plant & Equipment - Hire, Plant & Equipment - Purchase<br /><b>Specification Docs</b> : 1]]></description>
