<item><title>150-158 Cambridge Road, Warrane - New Stormwater Main</title>
<description><![CDATA[<b>Tender Details : </b> City of Clarence invites Quotations from suitably qualified Respondents to undertake Works to install new stormwater services for the benefit of properties situated at 150-158 Cambridge Road, Warrane, Tasmania, 7018.<br /><br />The Works include, but are not limited to:<br /><br />a) Piped stormwater drainage.<br /><br />b) Removal of sewer stormwater cross-connection and establish a new stormwater property connection (4 properties).<br /><br />c) Vegetation works and tree management.<br /><br />d) Removal and reinstatement of fence, shed and vegetable patch in the backyards.<br /><br />PRE-QUOTATION SITE MEETING (Mandatory Attendance)<br /><br />For clarification of the Works, a pre-quotation site meeting is scheduled for Tuesday 13th October 2026 at 11:30am. This meeting will convene at 158 Cambridge Road, Warrane. Because of the nature of the work requiring access to private properties, attendance at this meeting by the Respondent is mandatory. Respondents who have not complied with this requirement will n...<br /><br /><b>Issued by : </b> City of Clarence<br /><b>Closing Date</b> : 28/Oct/2026 03:00 PM (UTC+10:00) Hobart time<br /><b>Reference number</b> : VP528134<br /><b>Contact person</b> : Not disclosed<br /><b>Tender categories</b> : Construction & Operation, Water & Sewage<br /><b>Specification Docs</b> : 6]]></description>
