<item><title>CN-27574 - TIC-CO - North Coast DRFA 25HNO – Slope Remediation Package 1</title>
<description><![CDATA[<b>Tender Details : </b> The Department of Transport and Main Roads, North Coast Region, is seeking proposals for CN-27574 North Coast DRFA 25HNO – Slope Remediation Package 1 which involves remediation of several minor and major slope failures on Brisbane-Woodford Road (401), Samford-Mount Glorious Road (402), Mount-Glorious Road (4023), Samford Road (407) and Esk-Hampton Road (414).<br /><br />Contractors with TMR prequalification Major R3 and Financial F50 and above are invited to tender.<br /><br />Tenderers are advised the Queensland Code and Guidelines apply to this tender. <br /><br />Only TMR prequalified eligible tenderers will be given access to the Tender Documents via the QBuild eTender website: https://etender.hpw.qld.gov.au/. Prequalified tenderers are to email NC_Procurement_Inbox@tmr.qld.gov.au to gain access to the tender documents.<br /><br />Note: Due to an undeliverable message some users are experiencing, please type the email address into your email rather than using the copy and paste function.<br /><br />Tende...<br /><br /><b>Issued by : </b> Department of Transport and Main Roads-North Coast<br /><b>Closing Date</b> : 02/Nov/2026 02:00 PM (UTC+10:00) Brisbane time<br /><b>Reference number</b> : VP527865<br /><b>Contact person</b> : Not disclosed<br /><b>Tender categories</b> : Construction & Operation<br /><b>Specification Docs</b> : 0]]></description>
