<item><title>Preferred Supplier Arrangement (PSA) for Supply and Delivery of Wet Cement</title>
<description><![CDATA[<b>Tender Details : </b> This Contract establishes a Preferred Supply Arrangement for the supply and delivery of ready-mix (pre-mixed) concrete to support Livingstone Shire Council's works program. The arrangement includes the provision of a range of standard concrete strengths, including N20, N25, N32, N40, N50 and S50, with varying aggregate sizes as required.<br /><br />All materials, batching processes and deliveries must comply with relevant Australian Standards and industry specifications. Suppliers are responsible for the design and performance of concrete mixes and must ensure all products supplied meet the required standards and specifications.<br /><br />Purchases under the arrangement will be made on a job-by-job basis, with Council selecting the supplier that offers the best overall value for money, taking into consideration material quality, pricing (including transport costs), product availability, and response times.<br /><br /><b>Issued by : </b> Livingstone Shire Council<br /><b>Closing Date</b> : 23/Oct/2026 02:00 PM (UTC+10:00) Brisbane time<br /><b>Reference number</b> : VP528098<br /><b>Contact person</b> : Carmen Mundy Email: carmen.mundy@livingstone.qld.gov.au Tel: 07 4939 9881<br /><b>Tender categories</b> : Building Products & Materials<br /><b>Specification Docs</b> : 7]]></description>
