<item><title>Goondiwindi WWTP – Clarifier Renewal</title>
<description><![CDATA[<b>Tender Details : </b> Goondiwindi Regional Council have identified the requirement for the renewal of Primary Sedimentation Tank 1, referred to as Clarifier 1, at the Goondiwindi Wastewater Treatment Plant.<br /><br />Goondiwindi Regional Council Invites Tenders from suitably qualified, experienced and resourced Contractors for the design, supply, fabrication, removal, installation, testing and commissioning of the Clarifier 1 renewal and associated infrastructure.<br /><br />Completion of all components of the works, including commissioning, is required by 28th May 2027.<br /><br /><b>Issued by : </b> Goondiwindi Regional Council<br /><b>Closing Date</b> : 09/Nov/2026 09:00 AM (UTC+10:00) Brisbane time<br /><b>Reference number</b> : VP528088<br /><b>Contact person</b> : Not disclosed<br /><b>Tender categories</b> : Water & Sewage<br /><b>Specification Docs</b> : 6]]></description>
