<item><title>Scope and Design Capella Office Air Conditioning Upgrades</title>
<description><![CDATA[<b>Tender Details : </b> Central Highlands Regional Council (Council) is seeking submissions for the mechanical and electrical design, scoping and preparation of works for the replacement of the existing office air conditioning system at the Capella Council Office. <br /><br />The current system experiences frequent breakdowns and is nearing the end of its operational life, resulting in escalating costs for call-outs and issues finding replacement parts. These failures also cause discomfort for both staff and customers while repairs are undertaken. <br /><br />Council is seeking mechanical & electrical services for the upgrade of the AC units. <br /><br />Mechanical Services? <br /><br />- Detailed site investigation and verification of as-built conditions <br /><br />- Remaining operational life of the existing system <br /><br />- Heat load calculations for all conditioned spaces <br /><br />- Selection, sizing, and design of HVAC systems (Split system unless justified otherwise) <br /><br />- Decommissioning and safely dispose of ...<br /><br /><b>Issued by : </b> Central Highlands Regional Council<br /><b>Closing Date</b> : 23/Oct/2026 02:00 PM (UTC+10:00) Brisbane time<br /><b>Reference number</b> : VP526809<br /><b>Contact person</b> : Not disclosed<br /><b>Tender categories</b> : Building Trade, Repairs, Maint., Engineer, Research, Tech services, Mechanical Plant, Equip, Services<br /><b>Specification Docs</b> : 4]]></description>
