<item><title>Replace Recreation and Facilities Booking System Software</title>
<description><![CDATA[<b>Tender Details : </b> The objective of this RFQ is to engage a supplier to provide:<br /><br />•	A configurable and easy-to-use booking and customer management system;<br /><br />•	Online customer booking, registration and self-service capability;<br /><br />•	Membership and class management functionality;<br /><br />•	Event management and ticketing functionality;<br /><br />•	Integrated invoicing, receipting and payment processing;<br /><br />•	Strong reporting and audit capability;<br /><br />•	Appropriate financial controls and user permissions;<br /><br />•	Accessibility and inclusive design features;<br /><br />•	Ongoing support, training and system upgrades;<br /><br />•	Easily configured reporting.<br /><br />The successful supplier will provide all software, configuration, implementation services, training, support and associated services necessary to deliver a fit-for-purpose solution for Council.<br /><br /><b>Issued by : </b> Queanbeyan-Palerang Regional Council<br /><b>Closing Date</b> : 29/Oct/2026 02:00 PM (UTC+10:00) Canberra, Melbourne, Sydney time<br /><b>Reference number</b> : VP527809<br /><b>Contact person</b> : Not disclosed<br /><b>Tender categories</b> : IT & Telecomms<br /><b>Specification Docs</b> : 1]]></description>
