<item><title>EOI - Art and Light Installations for NarraBRIGHT 2027</title>
<description><![CDATA[<b>Tender Details : </b> Narrabri Shire Council is inviting Expressions of Interest (EOI) from artists and creatives for art and light installations for our annual NarraBRIGHT event, with the 2027 theme of Nature.<br /><br />Proudly presented by Narrabri Shire Council, NarraBRIGHT is a dynamic light and street festival that celebrates the vibrancy of our community, local businesses and town centre.<br /><br />Since its inception, NarraBRIGHT has grown into a signature event, attracting large audiences who gather to experience Narrabri’s illuminated CBD, large-scale projection features, artistic installations, inclusive activities, live music, food, shopping and entertainment for all ages.<br /><br />The event provides opportunities for artists, creatives and suppliers to showcase their work, engage with the community and contribute to a vibrant and memorable event experience.<br /><br />A key objective of NarraBRIGHT is to deliver a visually captivating event that celebrates creativity and artistry, while creating an inclusive space ...<br /><br /><b>Issued by : </b> Narrabri Shire Council<br /><b>Closing Date</b> : 21/Oct/2026 05:00 PM (UTC+10:00) Canberra, Melbourne, Sydney time<br /><b>Reference number</b> : VP527446<br /><b>Contact person</b> : Not disclosed<br /><b>Tender categories</b> : Event Management & Services, Graphical, Photographic & Art, Music, Game, Toy, Art, Craft & Edu, Travel & Tourism<br /><b>Specification Docs</b> : 1]]></description>
