<item><title>Forward Procurement Notice - The Wave Stage 3 (Metro)/MRI - CIP Independent Verifier</title>
<description><![CDATA[<b>Tender Details : </b> The Department of Transport and Main Roads (TMR) intends to release an Expression of Interest (EOI) in October 2026, for the provision of Independent Verifier services for the Civil Infrastructure Package (CIP) of The Wave 3 (Metro) and Mooloolah River Interchange Upgrade (MRI).<br /><br />This Forward Procurement Notice provides advance notice of the upcoming procurement and outlines preliminary information on the Independent Verifier (IV) services, including prequalification requirements. It is intended to assist interested proponents in assessing their capability, capacity, and potential interest in participating in the procurement process.<br /><br />Refer to the attached document for further information. <br /><br />No response is required to this Forward Procurement Notice. <br /><br />Questions are to be withheld until the forthcoming Expression of Interest (EOI) phase. Any questions asked on this advertisement will not be answered.<br /><br /><b>Issued by : </b> Department of Transport and Main Roads<br /><b>Closing Date</b> : 13/Oct/2026 05:00 PM (UTC+10:00) Brisbane time<br /><b>Reference number</b> : VP527529<br /><b>Contact person</b> : Not disclosed<br /><b>Tender categories</b> : Engineer, Research, Tech services<br /><b>Specification Docs</b> : 1]]></description>
