<item><title>NFAEP Marketing Material Delivery Services</title>
<description><![CDATA[<b>Tender Details : </b> The National Red Imported Fire Ant Program (The Program) is seeking marketing material delivery services to support campaigns in targeted areas across South East Queensland. <br /><br />This will include the delivery of a variety of printed promotional materials including but limited to unaddressed letters, flyers, information booklets, merchandise and postcards. <br /><br />Delivery locations will be within the local government areas of: Moreton Bay, Sunshine Coast, Somerset, Lockyer Valley, Scenic Rim, Toowoomba, Gold Coast and Brisbane City. Delivery to other areas may also be required. It is estimated that over 190,000 deliveries will be required during the contract period of up 30 June 2027.<br /><br />Further details of requirements can be found within the Request for Quote and Contract Details attachments.<br /><br /><b>Issued by : </b> Department of Primary Industries<br /><b>Closing Date</b> : 19/Oct/2026 02:00 PM (UTC+10:00) Brisbane time<br /><b>Reference number</b> : VP527610<br /><b>Contact person</b> : Not disclosed<br /><b>Tender categories</b> : Advertising and Media Services<br /><b>Specification Docs</b> : 2]]></description>
