<item><title>Tender 09-27 - PSA and RPQS for Arboriculture and Associated Services</title>
<description><![CDATA[<b>Tender Details : </b> GRC’s management of its urban forest, parks and open spaces and other regional areas is focussed on a range of priorities around the liveability and safety of the communities, environmental benefits to residents and the aesthetics of the suburbs. <br /><br />This will entail the delivery of both scheduled and unscheduled, reactive and proactive arboriculture services <br /><br />to attend to the tree assets across the greater region to ensure that all the priorities can be delivered. <br /><br />This tender shall result in the establishment of two separate arrangements: <br /><br />1) Preferred Supplier Arrangement (PSA); and <br /><br />2) Register of Pre-Qualified Suppliers (RPQS) <br /><br />Tenderers are invited to bid on one, or more of the arrangements. GRC may choose, in its absolute discretion, to award the PSA to different tenderers or award to one Tenderer.<br /><br /><b>Issued by : </b> Gladstone Regional Council<br /><b>Closing Date</b> : 27/Oct/2026 02:00 PM (UTC+10:00) Brisbane time<br /><b>Reference number</b> : VP527233<br /><b>Contact person</b> : Not disclosed<br /><b>Tender categories</b> : Horticulture & Arboriculture<br /><b>Specification Docs</b> : 19]]></description>
