<item><title>Trunk Watermain Construction</title>
<description><![CDATA[<b>Tender Details : </b> Tenders are invited from suitably qualified and experienced civil contractors for the construction of Council owned watermain infrastructure.<br /><br />The works generally include the supply and installation of new watermain infrastructure, fittings and associated connections, excavation and trenching, testing and commissioning, reinstatement and all other associated civil works required to complete the project.<br /><br />Tenderers are to refer to the attached Tender Documentation, Drawings, Specifications and Bill of Quantities for the full scope of works and tender requirements.<br /><br />The works are located at Reserve Road, Upper Coomera, Queensland.<br /><br /><b>Issued by : </b> COZENS REGAN GROUP PTY LTD<br /><b>Closing Date</b> : 09/Oct/2026 03:00 PM (UTC+10:00) Brisbane time<br /><b>Reference number</b> : VP527154<br /><b>Contact person</b> : Not disclosed<br /><b>Tender categories</b> : Water & Sewage<br /><b>Specification Docs</b> : 2]]></description>
