<item><title>RFQ for Client-Side ERP Project Manager</title>
<description><![CDATA[<b>Tender Details : </b> Barcoo Shire Council invites quotations from suitably qualified and experienced consultants to act as the Client-Side ERP Project Manager and Owner's Representative for the implementation of the Civica Authority Altitude SaaS ERP platform. The successful consultant will provide strategic project leadership, contract management, governance, change management, business process improvement, data migration assurance, testing oversight, and go-live support to ensure a successful ERP implementation and transition. The engagement will run from project mobilisation through implementation, stabilisation, and project closure.<br /><br /><b>Issued by : </b> Barcoo Shire Council<br /><b>Closing Date</b> : 09/Oct/2026 06:00 PM (UTC+10:00) Canberra, Melbourne, Sydney time<br /><b>Reference number</b> : VP527117<br /><b>Contact person</b> : Not disclosed<br /><b>Tender categories</b> : IT & Telecomms<br /><b>Specification Docs</b> : 3]]></description>
