<item><title>EOI - Management of Ocean Shores Tennis Courts</title>
<description><![CDATA[<b>Tender Details : </b> Byron Shire Council is seeking Expressions of Interest to Manage Ocean Shores Tennis Facility.<br /><br />Byron Shire Council is seeking a suitably qualified and experienced entity to manage the facility known as the Ocean Shores Tennis Courts, located in Waterlily Park, Ocean Shores and activate the site as outlined within this document and in accordance with its various objectives, policies, and plans. The venue is home to 2 synthetic tennis courts. The preference is for a not-for-profit community organisation to manage the Tennis Facility; however, Byron Shire Council invites and will consider submissions from all entities. The license period is to be negotiated, to a maximum of five years.<br /><br /><b>Issued by : </b> Byron Shire Council<br /><b>Closing Date</b> : 19/Oct/2026 02:00 PM (UTC+10:00) Canberra, Melbourne, Sydney time<br /><b>Reference number</b> : VP526799<br /><b>Contact person</b> : Not disclosed<br /><b>Tender categories</b> : Sport, Recreation Equip, Services, Venue Hire<br /><b>Specification Docs</b> : 2]]></description>
