<item><title>Supply of Performance Health Practitioner Services (Nutrition) - Swimming (Gold Coast)</title>
<description><![CDATA[<b>Tender Details : </b> Suppliers are invited by the Customer to submit an offer for Invitation to Offer No. 25DTS018B-NUTR (ITO16) for the provision of sport nutrition support. <br /><br />The Contractor will provide sport nutrition support to categorised podium, developing and emerging athletes in the QAS Swimming program. The contractor will also be responsible for developing strategies to support exceptional High-Performance outcomes. Services will primarily be conducted from Gold Coast Aquatic Centre. <br /><br />The services are to be provided for the equivalent of 1.5 days per week, which may be scheduled flexibly to meet program and athlete requirements. Services shall be provided for 48 weeks in each 12-month period.<br /><br />The proposed contract term is from November 2026 to 25 February 2029. <br /><br />The Contract Price will be based on a negotiated daily rate between $560 and $640 (excluding GST), depending on the successful Supplier's qualifications and experience. The daily rate is based on an 8-hour working day, ...<br /><br /><b>Issued by : </b> Queensland Academy of Sport<br /><b>Closing Date</b> : 15/Oct/2026 05:00 PM (UTC+10:00) Brisbane time<br /><b>Reference number</b> : VP527065<br /><b>Contact person</b> : Not disclosed<br /><b>Tender categories</b> : Healthcare Services<br /><b>Specification Docs</b> : 3]]></description>
