<item><title>T2027-02 Concrete Construction Footpaths and Kerbs</title>
<description><![CDATA[<b>Tender Details : </b> Council carries out varied concrete construction works as part of the councils operational program across the local government area. <br /><br />Works may include;<br /><br />•	Footpath new and replacement programs<br /><br />•	Kerb and gutters<br /><br />•	Insitu concrete structures ie drainage inlets, roundabouts and other related structures<br /><br />Engagement may occur in the following ways;<br /><br />1.	Full scope (Supply, deliver and install), (Supplier supply’s complete works materials and labour)<br /><br />2.	Formwork and labour. Council does the excavation and will supply steel and concrete and joints.<br /><br />3.	Council will excavate only. Everything else supplied by contractor.(Formwork, steel and concrete from the contractor)<br /><br /><br />This shall be a panel contract. The Contract will run for Three years in total (two years, with one-year extension based on supplier performance). The estimated start contract date will be approximately December 2026.<br /><br />This tender works inclu...<br /><br /><b>Issued by : </b> Cessnock City Council<br /><b>Closing Date</b> : 27/Oct/2026 02:00 PM (UTC+10:00) Canberra, Melbourne, Sydney time<br /><b>Reference number</b> : VP526727<br /><b>Contact person</b> : Not disclosed<br /><b>Tender categories</b> : Construction & Operation<br /><b>Specification Docs</b> : 7]]></description>
