<item><title>EOI: NS2703 Underground Civil Construction (UCC)</title>
<description><![CDATA[<b>Tender Details : </b> This EOI seeks to identify suppliers with the capability, capacity, resources and operational presence required to deliver underground civil construction services supporting Energy Queensland’s electricity networks across Queensland.<br /><br />Services may include trenching, conduit installation, cable hauling and placement, construction of pits, joint holes and bays, and specialist activities such as Horizontal Directional Drilling where integrated into a broader Underground Civil Construction work package.<br /><br />This open EOI covers the following proposed delivery tiers:<br /><br />•	Tier 1: Suppliers with an established or substantively committed operational presence in South East Queensland and the capability to deliver higher-value, higher-risk and more complex Transmission and Distribution civil construction works statewide. Tier 1 suppliers will be appointed as Principal Contractor for all work undertaken through this tier. Where electrical supervision is required, it must be provided through ele...<br /><br /><b>Issued by : </b> Energy Queensland Limited<br /><b>Closing Date</b> : 12/Oct/2026 02:00 PM (UTC+10:00) Brisbane time<br /><b>Reference number</b> : VP524971<br /><b>Contact person</b> : Belinda Crawford Email: belinda.crawford@energyq.com.au Tel: 0413 661 118<br /><b>Tender categories</b> : Construction & Operation<br /><b>Specification Docs</b> : 1]]></description>
