<pubDate>Tue, 22 Sep 2026 06:11:00 GMT</pubDate>
<category>Construction &amp; Operation</category>
</item>
<item><title>Construction of Concrete Pavement, Wash Bay And Beach Pit forWoorabinda Council Depot</title>
<description><![CDATA[<b>Tender Details : </b> The works include the construction of a new concrete pavement, a new wash bay area and beach pit construction in the existing Woorabinda Shire Council Workshop on 119 Carbibe Street ( 119SP268500). The Contractor shall undertake all construction works associated with the proposed civil infrastructure, including:<br /><br />•	Civil Earthworks<br /><br />•	Drainage and Gutter Upgrades<br /><br />•	Concrete Pavements and Hardstands<br /><br />•	Beach Pit Facility<br /><br />•	Hydraulic and Wash Bay Systems<br /><br />The contract includes provisional sum items which are to be priced but their execution is to be directed by the client. Woorabinda Aboriginal Shire Council (the Principal) may either provide these directly or reserve the right to negotiate their provision with the Main Contractor as part of the Works Under Contract (WUC). <br /><br />•	Vehicle Shade Structures (Provisional Sums)<br /><br />•	Fencing and Access Control Works (Provisional Sums)<br /><br /><b>Issued by : </b> Woorabinda Aboriginal Shire Council<br /><b>Closing Date</b> : 13/Oct/2026 04:00 PM (UTC+10:00) Brisbane time<br /><b>Reference number</b> : VP526714<br /><b>Contact person</b> : Not disclosed<br /><b>Tender categories</b> : Building Products & Materials, Building Trade, Repairs, Maint., Construction & Operation<br /><b>Specification Docs</b> : 8]]></description>
