<item><title>CSD equipment replacement for GCUH and Robina Hospital</title>
<description><![CDATA[<b>Tender Details : </b> Suppliers are invited by the Customer, Gold Coast Hospital and Health Service (GCHHS), to submit an offer in response to Invitation to Offer (ITO) No. TIIM-MC-007 – Central Sterilisation Department (CSD) Equipment Replacement for both Gold Coast University Hospital (GCUH) and Robina Hospital (RH).<br /><br />This procurement represents a critical component of Gold Coast Health's broader program of works to ensure the Central Sterilisation Departments at Gold Coast University Hospital and Robina Hospital are appropriately equipped to meet current and future service requirements and the requirements of AS 5369:2023. Gold Coast Health has undertaken detailed design for the complete package of works. Relevant design documentation, technical requirements, specifications, drawings, operational requirements and other information provided within the Invitation to Offer (ITO) have been included to support the development of the Supplier's Offer.<br /><br />Please refer to<br /><br />- TIIM-MC-007 CSD ITO Part A - ITO ...<br /><br /><b>Issued by : </b> GCHHS - Asset Management Services<br /><b>Closing Date</b> : 22/Oct/2026 05:00 PM (UTC+10:00) Brisbane time<br /><b>Reference number</b> : VP526695<br /><b>Contact person</b> : Fionna Pritchard Email: fionna.pritchard@health.qld.gov.au Tel: 0419390995<br /><b>Tender categories</b> : Medical Equipment. & Supplies<br /><b>Specification Docs</b> : 9]]></description>
