<item><title>Community Hub Cafe Operational Lease and Fitout</title>
<description><![CDATA[<b>Tender Details : </b> Mackay Regional Council invites suitably qualified and experienced café, hospitality, food and beverage operators to submit a tender for the lease, fit-out and operation of a new café/eatery within the Northern Beaches Community Hub at Rural View, Mackay.<br /><br />This opportunity includes a retail shop lease, delivery of a tenant fit-out within a purpose-built café tenancy, and operation of a vibrant community-focused café destination servicing library users, community groups, families, visitors and the broader Northern Beaches community. Council may consider a fit-out contribution towards approved fit-out works.<br /><br />Tenderers are sought with experience in café operations, hospitality management, food service, community activation, commercial fit-outs and customer-focused service delivery.<br /><br />The opportunity includes indoor dining, kitchen facilities and an outdoor dining area, with flexibility for innovative café concepts, community partnerships and activation initiatives.<br /><br />A site...<br /><br /><b>Issued by : </b> Mackay Regional Council<br /><b>Closing Date</b> : 08/Oct/2026 10:00 AM (UTC+10:00) Brisbane time<br /><b>Reference number</b> : VP525929<br /><b>Contact person</b> : Not disclosed<br /><b>Tender categories</b> : Catering & Hospitality, Travel & Tourism<br /><b>Specification Docs</b> : 8]]></description>
