<item><title>HSQF Cultural Auditor and Resource Enhancement (CARE) Project</title>
<description><![CDATA[<b>Tender Details : </b> The HSQF Cultural Auditor and Resource Enhancement (CARE) Project seeks to engage a First Nations organisation to provide project co-ordination recruiting up to 10 First Nations people to receive training, support and resources to achieve a Certificate in Lead Auditing. The successful organisation will create a scholarship which seeks to support First Nations people to undertake training to gain qualifications and experience in HSQF auditing. The successful organisation will arrange recruitment, co-ordinate schedules, arrange shadow audits with HSQF Certification Bodies and support the learning process for the scholarship recipients.<br /><br /><b>Issued by : </b> Families, Seniors, Disability Serv & Child Safety<br /><b>Closing Date</b> : 14/Oct/2026 05:00 PM (UTC+10:00) Brisbane time<br /><b>Reference number</b> : VP525756<br /><b>Contact person</b> : Not disclosed<br /><b>Tender categories</b> : Community & Social Services, Financial & Insurance Services, Management Advisory Services, Training & Development<br /><b>Specification Docs</b> : 1]]></description>
