<pubDate>Tue, 15 Sep 2026 04:25:00 GMT</pubDate>
<category>IT &amp; Telecomms</category>
<category>Waste Management &amp; Landfill</category>
</item>
<item><title>Generator tender</title>
<description><![CDATA[<b>Tender Details : </b> Estimated 5-year contract for Generator Servicing & Diesel Tank Inspections throughout the Torres and Cape Hospital and Health Service. seeking to establish a Service Agreement for the provision of Preventative, Corrective Maintenance of Generators and Diesel Generator Power Plant equipment operated and located at Torres and Cape Hospital and Health Service facilities. The Torres and Cape Hospital and Health Service own and operate a range of Generators and Diesel Generator Power Plant Equipment that provide emergency power supply to facilities and infrastructure. Maintenance is required to optimise their performance over the life of the equipment to ensure security of power supply.<br /><br />Objectives:<br /><br />(i)	Preventative maintenance<br /><br />(ii)	Corrective maintenance, including 24 hour, 7 days per week (including gazetted public holidays) Breakdown Support and Emergency Call-Outs; and<br /><br />(iii)	Testing and certification<br /><br />(iv)	Supply and Installation<br /><br /><b>Issued by : </b> Torres and Cape Hospital and Health Service<br /><b>Closing Date</b> : 20/Oct/2026 03:00 PM (UTC+10:00) Brisbane time<br /><b>Reference number</b> : VP522676<br /><b>Contact person</b> : Not disclosed<br /><b>Tender categories</b> : Building Trade, Repairs, Maint., Fuel & Oils, Gas Energy, Infrastructure, Equipment, Plant & Equipment - Purchase, Power Generation, Trans & Distrib., Utilities<br /><b>Specification Docs</b> : 7]]></description>
