<description><![CDATA[<b>Tender Details : </b> SMRC invites submissions from suitably qualified and experienced concrete suppliers for inclusion in Council’s concrete supply panel (the Panel).<br /><br />The Panel will comprise a range of suitably qualified and experienced concrete suppliers capable of supporting Council’s day-to-day operational activities across various service areas. Successful Respondents will be appointed to the Panel and may be engaged by Council to provide materials on a ‘as required’ basis in accordance with an agreed Schedule of Rates for works delivered under the Standing Offer Deed or other project specific contract. <br /><br />The purpose of establishing the Panel is to ensure Council has timely, efficient and value-for-money access to a concrete material required to maintain community assets and support ongoing operational service delivery.<br /><br /><b>Issued by : </b> Snowy Monaro Regional Council<br /><b>Closing Date</b> : 19/Oct/2026 05:00 PM (UTC+10:00) Canberra, Melbourne, Sydney time<br /><b>Reference number</b> : VP524445<br /><b>Contact person</b> : Not disclosed<br /><b>Tender categories</b> : Building Products & Materials<br /><b>Specification Docs</b> : 7]]></description>
