<item><title>Waste and Resource Recovery Digital Engagement Platform</title>
<description><![CDATA[<b>Tender Details : </b> The procurement is for the provision, implementation, hosting, support and ongoing maintenance of a Waste and Resource Recovery Digital Engagement Platform, including a mobile application, publicly accessible web-based collection calendar, website integration tools and a secure administration portal.<br /><br />The solution must provide Council with the ability to independently manage and update content through a secure, web-based administration portal without requiring supplier intervention for routine operational changes.<br /><br />The successful supplier will provide:<br /><br />•	iOS and Android mobile applications.<br /><br />•	Cloud hosting, software licensing, cybersecurity, upgrades and technical support.<br /><br />•	Property-specific waste collection calendars.<br /><br />•	Public web-based collection calendar suitable for integration into Council's website.<br /><br />•	Bin collection reminder notifications.<br /><br />•	Property based, geographic and service-area-specific notifications.<br /><br ...<br /><br /><b>Issued by : </b> Penrith City Council<br /><b>Closing Date</b> : 09/Oct/2026 02:00 PM (UTC+10:00) Canberra, Melbourne, Sydney time<br /><b>Reference number</b> : VP525360<br /><b>Contact person</b> : Not disclosed<br /><b>Tender categories</b> : IT & Telecomms, Waste Management & Landfill<br /><b>Specification Docs</b> : 3]]></description>
