<item><title>TL26-00372 – Invitation to Offer – 2026 Diesel Bus Fleet Procurement</title>
<description><![CDATA[<b>Tender Details : </b> The Department of Transport and Main Roads is undertaking this procurement to acquire 630 Euro VI (or greater) diesel buses to support the continued delivery of public transport services across South East Queensland and meet future service delivery requirements. <br /><br />The Government is delivering more jobs and better services through a stronger economy and getting on with the job of delivering a modern bus fleet to keep South East Queensland moving. This investment will deliver 630 new buses across Queensland and replace ageing vehicles, boost reliability, improve accessibility and ensure the network keeps pace with a fast-growing State. The Better Bus Build will provide the vehicles needed to maintain service continuity across the State while creating a pipeline of work for industry and strengthening the capability of Queensland's transport network.<br /><br />The procurement supports a transition to State ownership of the bus assets, enabling greater control, consistency, service continuity and long-t...<br /><br /><b>Issued by : </b> DeptTransport&MainRoads-NSO Commercial Partnership<br /><b>Closing Date</b> : 19/Oct/2026 12:00 PM (UTC+10:00) Brisbane time<br /><b>Reference number</b> : VP525316<br /><b>Contact person</b> : Not disclosed<br /><b>Tender categories</b> : Transport, Freight, Logistics, Vehicles<br /><b>Specification Docs</b> : 25]]></description>
