<item><title>EOI - ELECTRIC VEHICLE CHARGING IN CITY OF VINCENT CAR PARKS</title>
<description><![CDATA[<b>Tender Details : </b> The City of Vincent is seeking experienced electric vehicle (EV) charging providers to install, operate and maintain public EV charging infrastructure across its car park portfolio.<br /><br />The opportunity is intended to expand access to public charging, support the uptake of electric vehicles, and provide charging solutions that reflect the different parking durations and user needs across the City’s activity centres, recreation precincts and community destinations.<br /><br />The City of Vincent invites suitably qualified proponents to submit an Expression of Interest (EOI) for the licensing of car parking bays within any of the 13 car parks listed within the attached document, for use as EV charging bays.<br /><br />Please refer to the attached EOI document for all information - including how to submit a response.<br /><br />The EOI closes at 2pm (WST) on Monday 19 October.<br /><br /><b>Issued by : </b> City of Vincent<br /><b>Closing Date</b> : 19/Oct/2026 02:00 PM (UTC+08:00) Perth time<br /><b>Reference number</b> : VP525253<br /><b>Contact person</b> : Not disclosed<br /><b>Tender categories</b> : ELEC, Lighting, Equip & Services, Electronic Components & Supplies, Fleet Servicing & Accessories, Parking, Traffic Services & Equip<br /><b>Specification Docs</b> : 1]]></description>
