<item><title>TEN16798 - Provision of Maintenance Services for Wet Play Assets and Equipment</title>
<description><![CDATA[<b>Tender Details : </b> Rockhampton Regional Council is seeking a suitably qualified contractor to provide preventative and corrective maintenance services for Wet Play facilities and associated equipment across four (4) locations. The objective of this contract is to ensure the ongoing safety, functionality, and enjoyment of these facilities for the community.<br /><br />The Contractor will utilise its maintenance management processes, systems, and resources to support Council's objectives of delivering safe, cost-effective, reliable, and sustainable assets.<br /><br />Locations<br /><br />42nd Battalion Memorial Pool - 330-360 Berserker Street, Frenchville QLD 4701<br /><br />2nd World War Memorial Aquatic Centre - 2 Graeme Acton Way, Rockhampton City QLD 4700<br /><br />Cedric Archer Park - Ian Besch Drive, Gracemere QLD 4702<br /><br />Mount Morgan Swimming Pool - 36 Thompson Avenue, Mount Morgan QLD 4714<br /><br /><br />A site meeting will be conducted commencing at 330-360 Berserker Street, Frenchville 4701 - 7:30am 23rd Sept...<br /><br /><b>Issued by : </b> Rockhampton Regional Council<br /><b>Closing Date</b> : 07/Oct/2026 02:00 PM (UTC+10:00) Brisbane time<br /><b>Reference number</b> : VP524196<br /><b>Contact person</b> : Not disclosed<br /><b>Tender categories</b> : Sport, Recreation Equip, Services<br /><b>Specification Docs</b> : 1]]></description>
