<item><title>001489_Estate Precinct (B060 Refurbishment)</title>
<description><![CDATA[<b>Tender Details : </b> JCU (The Principal) intends to refurbish Building 060 within the Estate Precinct located at Bebegu Yumba campus in order to accommodate the relocation of the Boating and Diving department.<br /><br />The Contractor shall undertake the design development, certification, refurbishment works, service modifications, commissioning and handover of the facility under a Medium Works Contract.<br /><br />The Principal will provide:<br /><br />•	Architectural Sketch Design.<br /><br />•	JCU General Preliminaries.<br /><br />•	JCU Design Guidelines and Specifications (available at: Design Guidelines - Estate - JCU Australia)<br /><br />•	Space Data Sheets.<br /><br />•	Minimum Electrical Plan (preliminary, not for construction).<br /><br />•	Compressor Airline Arrangement, Layout, and Air Line Layout photographs (indicative information only; not for design or construction use – to be confirmed with Integrated Safety Group).<br /><br />•	Existing available building information (indicative only).<br /><br /><b>Issued by : </b> James Cook University<br /><b>Closing Date</b> : 09/Oct/2026 05:00 PM (UTC+10:00) Brisbane time<br /><b>Reference number</b> : VP525124<br /><b>Contact person</b> : Hayley Learman Email: hayley.learman@jcu.edu.au Tel: 0420649426<br /><b>Tender categories</b> : Building Products & Materials, Building Trade, Repairs, Maint., Construction & Operation, Mechanical Plant, Equip, Services<br /><b>Specification Docs</b> : 17]]></description>
