<item><title>AssetAI-Compatible Camera Systems &amp; AI-Assisted Road Defect Inspection Services</title>
<description><![CDATA[<b>Tender Details : </b> MidCoast Council manages approximately 3,630 km of roads and is seeking an end-to-end solution for vehicle-mounted imagery, AI-assisted road-defect inspection, human review, structured data exchange and ongoing service support. The solution will be used across Council’s road network and may be expanded to other transport assets and post-disaster inspection activities.<br /><br />The base deployment comprises seven cameras permanently installed on JR Richards & Sons waste and recycling trucks and one relocatable camera system capable of deployment to Council Utes, maintenance vehicles, ATVs, bicycles or other suitable transport. The Tenderer must verify fleet, vehicle, electrical and operating assumptions during mobilisation.<br /><br /><b>Issued by : </b> MidCoast Council<br /><b>Closing Date</b> : 22/Oct/2026 02:00 PM (UTC+10:00) Canberra, Melbourne, Sydney time<br /><b>Reference number</b> : VP525087<br /><b>Contact person</b> : Not disclosed<br /><b>Tender categories</b> : Engineer, Research, Tech services, IT & Telecomms<br /><b>Specification Docs</b> : 7]]></description>
