<item><title>Bairnsdale Aerodrome Runway 04/22 Upgrade - Design and Construct</title>
<description><![CDATA[<b>Tender Details : </b> Council requires the Bairnsdale Aerodrome Runway 04/22 to be designed and constructed as a CASA Part 139 (Aerodromes) MOS-compliant Code 3 runway that safely accommodates the confirmed design aircraft and forecast operations. The completed works must deliver a certified geometry, grading, drainage, pavement, airfield ground lighting (AGL), line marking and surface-friction system that returns the aerodrome to operational service.<br /><br /><b>Issued by : </b> East Gippsland Shire Council<br /><b>Closing Date</b> : 21/Oct/2026 02:00 PM (UTC+10:00) Canberra, Melbourne, Sydney time<br /><b>Reference number</b> : VP524874<br /><b>Contact person</b> : Not disclosed<br /><b>Tender categories</b> : Building Products & Materials, Building Trade, Repairs, Maint., Construction & Operation<br /><b>Specification Docs</b> : 13]]></description>
