<item><title>Targeted Refresh of GGS0111-24 Professional Services Preferred Supplier Panel</title>
<description><![CDATA[<b>Tender Details : </b> Queensland Government Procurement, Department of Housing and Public Works (DHPW) has issued this Invitation to Apply (ITA) seeking applications for a targeted refresh of the whole of government Professional Services Preferred Supplier Panel (PSP) GGS0111-24. <br /><br />The Professional Services PSP is a whole-of-government panel for the provision of professional and consulting services. There are currently ~470 suppliers offering services across 10 categories and 29 sub-categories.<br /><br />This refresh is aimed at strengthening specific supplier types. Accordingly, only suppliers who meet one or more of the following supplier types may apply for this refresh process:<br /><br /> • Aboriginal and Torres Strait Islander businesses<br /><br />• Social Enterprises<br /><br />• Queensland Regional Businesses<br /><br />• Veteran owned and/or operated Queensland businesses.<br /><br />For full details, please refer to Part A: Invitation to Apply.<br /><br />Suppliers who are currently appointed to PSP GGS0111-2...<br /><br /><b>Issued by : </b> General Goods & Services – Qld Govt Procurement<br /><b>Closing Date</b> : 14/Oct/2026 10:00 AM (UTC+10:00) Brisbane time<br /><b>Reference number</b> : VP524716<br /><b>Contact person</b> : Not disclosed<br /><b>Tender categories</b> : Business & Administrative Services, Engineer, Research, Tech services, Financial & Insurance Services, HR Services & Recruitment, Management Advisory Services, Marketing & Communications, Real Estate & Property Services, Training & Development<br /><b>Specification Docs</b> : 14]]></description>
