<description><![CDATA[<b>Tender Details : </b> The Department of Sport, Racing and Olympic and Paralympic Games (DSROPG) invites Expressions of Interest from suitably qualified and experienced café and hospitality operators to lease and operate the existing café facility at Sunshine Coast Recreation Precinct (SCRP).<br /><br />DSROPG will conduct an optional site inspection and industry briefing at Sunshine Coast Recreation Precinct, 80 Currimundi Road, Currimundi QLD, to provide interested respondents with an opportunity to inspect the café facility and ask questions relating to the EOI on 9.30-10.30am Tuesday 15 September 2026.<br /><br />Respondents wishing to attend must register their attendance, including the names of no more than three personnel, by emailing procurement@sport.qld.gov.au no later than 10am Monday 14th September 2026.<br /><br />Any information provided during the site inspection or industry briefing that may affect respondent submissions will be communicated to all respondents.<br /><br />To assist with your submission following doc...<br /><br /><b>Issued by : </b> Dept of Sport, Racing and Olympic Paralympic Games<br /><b>Closing Date</b> : 09/Oct/2026 11:00 AM (UTC+10:00) Brisbane time<br /><b>Reference number</b> : VP524695<br /><b>Contact person</b> : Not disclosed<br /><b>Tender categories</b> : Travel & Tourism<br /><b>Specification Docs</b> : 4]]></description>
