<item><title>ITT267 - Design and Construct Sports House - Sunshine Coast Stadium</title>
<description><![CDATA[<b>Tender Details : </b> Sunshine Coast Council (Council) is seeking to engage an experienced and appropriately qualified Principal Contractor to design and construct a new Sports House within the Sunshine Coast Stadium, located at 31 Sportsmans Parade, Bokarina.<br /><br />The scope of work includes electrical enabling works, demolition of the existing building, and the design and construction of a new Sports House on largely the same footprint.<br /><br />Design Works will include, but not be limited to:<br /><br />•	Preliminary Design;<br /><br />•	Detailed Design;<br /><br />•	Council Review meetings;<br /><br />•	All approvals, and permits; <br /><br />Construction Works will include, but not be limited to: <br /><br />•	Enabling works comprising electrical infrastructure amendments;<br /><br />•	Demolition of the existing Sports House;<br /><br />•	Construction of a new Sports House;<br /><br />•	Civil works as required to adjust levels;<br /><br />•	Full remediation of the demolition site;<br /><br />•	Landscape and full remed...<br /><br /><b>Issued by : </b> Sunshine Coast Council<br /><b>Closing Date</b> : 20/Oct/2026 12:00 PM (UTC+10:00) Brisbane time<br /><b>Reference number</b> : VP524145<br /><b>Contact person</b> : Not disclosed<br /><b>Tender categories</b> : Construction & Operation<br /><b>Specification Docs</b> : 41]]></description>
