<item><title>ITT264 - Streetscape Upgrade - Mill and Currie Streets Nambour</title>
<description><![CDATA[<b>Tender Details : </b> Sunshine Coast Council is seeking a suitably qualified contractor to construct streetscaping, roadworks and a signalised crossing at, and adjacent to the intersection of Mill and Currie Streets, Nambour.<br /><br />The scope of work includes, but is not limited to:<br /><br />• Signalised pedestrian crossing<br /><br />• Lighting<br /><br />• Road pavement works<br /><br />• Concrete pavement construction;<br /><br />• Paved pathway construction;<br /><br />• Landscaped gardens;<br /><br />• Concrete driveways and kerb ramps;<br /><br />• Signage and line marking;<br /><br />• Kerb & channel works;<br /><br />• Stormwater drainage works;<br /><br />• Supply and Installation of precast islands;<br /><br />• Public utility alterations.<br /><br />Council will appoint a Certifying Engineer in accordance with the requirements of the TMR conditional approval and a superintendent to assess and certify claims, EOT’s and variations.<br /><br />As required by TMR’s prequalification system guidelines, all works within ...<br /><br /><b>Issued by : </b> Sunshine Coast Council<br /><b>Closing Date</b> : 20/Oct/2026 12:00 PM (UTC+10:00) Brisbane time<br /><b>Reference number</b> : VP523983<br /><b>Contact person</b> : Not disclosed<br /><b>Tender categories</b> : Construction & Operation, Furniture & Furnishings<br /><b>Specification Docs</b> : 21]]></description>
