<item><title>Construction &amp; Upgrade of Recreational Precinct - William Taylor Memorial Sportsfield, Redland City</title>
<description><![CDATA[<b>Tender Details : </b> Redland City Council (“RCC”) requires a head Contractor for the construction and upgrade of the existing active Recreation Infrastructure/Recreational Zone including a new and contemporary district level skatepark, BMX track, new pétanque arena, rebound wall and Basketball court, Park Shelter, park furniture and elements, connecting pathways, new Amenities Block and Electrical Pathway Lighting and associated works. <br /><br />Please refer to the Tender Package for the full scope of works.<br /><br /><b>Issued by : </b> Redland City Council<br /><b>Closing Date</b> : 07/Oct/2026 02:00 PM (UTC+10:00) Brisbane time<br /><b>Reference number</b> : VP524297<br /><b>Contact person</b> : Not disclosed<br /><b>Tender categories</b> : Construction & Operation, Sport, Recreation Equip, Services<br /><b>Specification Docs</b> : 33]]></description>
