<item><title>Loxton House Refurbishment and Conservation Works</title>
<description><![CDATA[<b>Tender Details : </b> Muswellbrook Shire Council (the Principal) invites suitably qualified Contractors to tender for the Loxton House Refurbishment and Conservation Works at 142–144 Bridge Street, Muswellbrook, New South Wales. Loxton House is a State Heritage listed building. <br /><br /> <br /><br />The project involves the comprehensive refurbishment of the existing three-level heritage building to facilitate its adaptive reuse as a mixed-use commercial facility comprising: <br /><br /> <br /><br />a restaurant within the Lower Ground Floor; <br /><br />commercial office tenancies on the Ground Floor; <br /><br />commercial office tenancy on Level 1; and <br /><br />associated amenities and supporting building services. <br /><br /> <br /><br />The Works include structural remediation, roof refurbishment and associated modifications, heritage conservation works, accessibility upgrades, building services replacement, internal refurbishment and fit-out, together with associated external works. <br /><br /> <br /><br />At the tim...<br /><br /><b>Issued by : </b> Muswellbrook Shire Council<br /><b>Closing Date</b> : 06/Oct/2026 02:00 PM (UTC+10:00) Canberra, Melbourne, Sydney time<br /><b>Reference number</b> : VP524208<br /><b>Contact person</b> : Not disclosed<br /><b>Tender categories</b> : Construction & Operation<br /><b>Specification Docs</b> : 41]]></description>
