<category>Construction &amp; Operation</category>
</item>
<item><title>2627-63 LOAD, CART AND SUPPLY TYPE 3.2 and Type 4.3 MATERIAL TO YELARBON-KEETAH RD, YELARBON</title>
<description><![CDATA[<b>Tender Details : </b> Type 3.2	Load, Cart and Supply MRTS05 confirming Type 3.2 material to construction project on Yelarbon-Keetah Rd, Yelarbon. Between chainage 6.4-7.4km <br /><br />Type 4.3	Load, Cart and Supply MRTS05 confirming Type 4.3 material to construction project on Desert Creek Road, Yelarbon. Between chainage 0-0.3km.<br /><br />3.2	SPECIFICATION<br /><br />3.2.1	All Type 3.2 and Type 4.3 Material supplied shall conform to the Department of Transport and Main Roads Technical Specifications MRTS05 Unbound Pavements.<br /><br />3.3	DELIVERY, STORAGE AND MEASUREMENT – TYPE 3.2 AND TYPE 4.3 PAVEMENT MATERIAL<br /><br />3.3.1	Trucks delivering unbound pavement material shall be legally loaded at all times to their full capacity and no part loads will be accepted. <br /><br />3.3.2	Delivery shall be to the road works and tipped within each lot or as instructed by the works supervisor (Russell Mortimer) <br /><br />3.3.3	Material is to be supplied in equivalent dry tonnes. Material will be tested upon delivery to determine ...<br /><br /><b>Issued by : </b> Goondiwindi Regional Council<br /><b>Closing Date</b> : 08/Oct/2026 12:00 PM (UTC+10:00) Brisbane time<br /><b>Reference number</b> : VP524027<br /><b>Contact person</b> : Not disclosed<br /><b>Tender categories</b> : Building Products & Materials<br /><b>Specification Docs</b> : 1]]></description>
