<item><title>TRC000590 Preferred supplier arrangement for the supply and delivery of temporary fence hire</title>
<description><![CDATA[<b>Tender Details : </b> Toowoomba Regional Council (Council) is seeking suppliers for the provision of wet and/or dry hire of site temporary fencing, on an as required basis for the entire region. This tender will be awarded to a panel of suppliers who can demonstrate that they:<br /><br />•	Can provide a range of products suitable to Council’s requirements in a timely and efficient manner;<br /><br />•	Can provide a hire service seven (7) days a week suitable to Council’s requirements; and<br /><br />•	Are prepared to provide such products to Council on the terms and conditions set out in the offer document and relating documents.<br /><br />Types of equipment to be covered under this quote are site security and site safety products that may include but are not limited to:<br /><br />•	Temporary Mesh Fencing;<br /><br />•	Temporary Hoarding Fence;<br /><br />•	Crowd Barrier Fencing;<br /><br />•	Temporary Pool Fencing; <br /><br />•	Temporary Event Fencing.<br /><br /><b>Issued by : </b> Toowoomba Regional Council<br /><b>Closing Date</b> : 06/Oct/2026 02:00 PM (UTC+10:00) Brisbane time<br /><b>Reference number</b> : VP523144<br /><b>Contact person</b> : Not disclosed<br /><b>Tender categories</b> : Building Trade, Repairs, Maint., Construction & Operation, Event Management & Services<br /><b>Specification Docs</b> : 8]]></description>
