<item><title>RFT2425/022 - Events Goods &amp; Services Panel</title>
<description><![CDATA[<b>Tender Details : </b> The City is seeking applications from suitably qualified and experienced suppliers to join a Panel of pre-approved providers for the delivery of a range of event-related goods and services in support of the City’s community and major events program, including but not limited to;<br /><br />a)	Festivals (e.g., Christmas in the City, Skyfest, Youth Week, Arts);<br /><br />b)	Civic ceremonies;<br /><br />c)	Community activations (e.g. Walk for Reconciliation); and<br /><br />d)	Major sporting events.<br /><br />The City delivers a varied program of events and community activations throughout the year, ranging from major sporting events to smaller activities for families, young people, culturally and linguistically diverse communities, local businesses and visitors.<br /><br />To support safe and professional event delivery, the City is establishing a Panel of Prequalified Suppliers across ten (10) categories, each covering a distinct area of work. Respondents should nominate the category or categories relevant t...<br /><br /><b>Issued by : </b> City of Bunbury<br /><b>Closing Date</b> : 07/Oct/2026 12:00 PM (UTC+08:00) Perth time<br /><b>Reference number</b> : VP520897<br /><b>Contact person</b> : Alec Williams Email: alecwilliams@bunbury.wa.gov.au Tel: 0897927171<br /><b>Tender categories</b> : Audio Visual Photo Equip & Supp., Building Products & Materials, Construction & Operation, Event Management & Services, Furniture & Furnishings, Parking, Traffic Services & Equip, Plant & Equipment - Hire, Security Services & Equipment, Signs & Barriers<br /><b>Specification Docs</b> : 3]]></description>
