<pubDate>Mon, 17 Aug 2026 04:17:00 GMT</pubDate>
<category>Utilities</category>
</item>
<item><title>TEN/3083 - Disposal of Old Show Grounds Site, 45 Burrum Street, Bundaberg West</title>
<description><![CDATA[<b>Tender Details : </b> Council is inviting offers from suitably qualified Respondents to purchase and develop the balance of the property located at 45 Burrum Street, Bundaberg West, via tender.<br /><br />Property<br /><br />Council is the owner of the freehold parcel, described as Lot 4 on SP270831 known as 45 Burrum Street, Bundaberg West, Queensland, Australia, 4670 (‘Property’). The site is bounded by Civic Avenue, Burrum Street, Pyefinch Boulevard and Saltwater Creek, and has an area of 7.0895 hectares, in its current form.<br /><br />The Property is the remains of the former Bundaberg Showgrounds, and currently has minimal physical infrastructure on the site, but does include the remaining Bailey Gate which is a Local Heritage Place in the Bundaberg Regional Council Planning Scheme 2015. The northern portion of the site is currently occupied by the Campervan and Motorhome Club of Australia (‘CMCA’) under a lease agreement to operate a caravan park for their members. This lease area roughly aligns with the area impacted by Co...<br /><br /><b>Issued by : </b> Bundaberg Regional Council<br /><b>Closing Date</b> : 06/Oct/2026 02:00 PM (UTC+10:00) Brisbane time<br /><b>Reference number</b> : VP521291<br /><b>Contact person</b> : Not disclosed<br /><b>Tender categories</b> : Architecture, Design, Planning, Business & Administrative Services, Community & Social Services, Real Estate & Property Services, Travel & Tourism<br /><b>Specification Docs</b> : 2]]></description>
